msgid ""
"Extra vertical space between lines, in pixels. Affects readability and line "
"density in the editor."
msgstr "行與行之間額外的垂直間距（像素），會影響編輯器的可讀性與行密度。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:627
msgid "Tab Stops"
msgstr "定位點"

