msgstr "為章節啟用黏性捲動"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:738
msgid ""
"Show the current section header at the top of the editor while scrolling."
msgstr "捲動時，在編輯器頂端顯示目前章節的標題。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:740
msgid ""
"Displays a sticky header at the top of the editor showing the current "
"section hierarchy (chapter, section, subsection, etc.) as you scroll through "
"long documents."
msgstr ""
"在編輯器頂端顯示固定的懸浮標題，隨著您捲動長文件，呈現目前的章節階層"
"（chapter、section、subsection 等）。"

